
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1020">
<meta name="description" content="Welcome to YoFath, my personal portfolio.">
<title>YoFath — My World</title>
<style>
:root {
  --bg:#0b1020;
  --panel:#131c30;
  --blue:#60a5fa;
  --text:#f8fafc;
  --muted:#a9b7ce;
}
* {box-sizing:border-box}
html {scroll-behavior:smooth}
body {
  margin:0;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.65;
}
a {color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
nav {
  max-width:1050px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:20px;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  gap:15px;
}
.logo {font-size:27px;font-weight:800}
.logo span {color:var(--blue)}
.links {display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:14px}
.links a:hover {color:var(--blue)}
.hero {
  max-width:1050px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:100px 22px 90px;
  text-align:center;
}
.eyebrow {
  color:var(--blue);
  font-weight:bold;
  letter-spacing:3px;
  font-size:12px;
}
h1 {
  font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,76px);
  line-height:1.12;
  letter-spacing:-2px;
  margin:20px 0;
}
h1 span {
  color:var(--blue);
}
.intro {
  max-width:590px;
  margin:0 auto 28px;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:17px;
}
.button {
  display:inline-block;
  padding:12px 21px;
  margin:5px;
  border-radius:10px;
  background:var(--blue);
  color:#08101f;
  font-weight:bold;
  transition:transform .2s;
}
.button:hover {transform:translateY(-3px)}
.button.secondary {
  color:var(--text);
  background:var(--panel);
  border:1px solid #33415c;
}
section {
  max-width:1000px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:65px 22px;
}
.section-title {
  font-size:32px;
  margin:0 0 12px;
}
.sub {
  color:var(--muted);
  margin-top:0;
}
.grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:18px;
  margin-top:25px;
}
.card {
  background:var(--panel);
  border:1px solid #26344d;
  border-radius:18px;
  padding:25px;
  transition:transform .2s,border-color .2s;
}
.card:hover {
  transform:translateY(-4px);
  border-color:var(--blue);
}
.card h3 {margin:10px 0}
.card p {color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:0}
.symbol {font-size:27px}
.socials {
  display:flex;
  gap:12px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:20px;
}
.socials a {
  border:1px solid #33415c;
  background:var(--panel);
  padding:11px 16px;
  border-radius:10px;
}
.socials a:hover {
  border-color:var(--blue);
  color:var(--blue);
}
footer {
  text-align:center;
  padding:28px 15px;
  border-top:1px solid #26344d;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:13px;
}
@media(max-width:600px) {
  nav {padding:16px}
  .links {gap:10px;font-size:12px}
  .hero {padding:75px 20px}
  .grid {grid-template-columns:1fr}
  section {padding:48px 20px}
  h1 {letter-spacing:-1px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a class="logo" href="#home">YoFath<span>.</span></a>
  <div class="links">
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
  <header class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO MY WORLD</div>
    <h1>Building my<br><span>own future.</span></h1>
    <p class="intro">
      A personal space for my journey, creativity,
      projects and ideas. This is where my story begins.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="#projects">Explore my world ↗</a>
    <a class="button secondary" href="#about">About me</a>
  </header>

  <section id="about">
    <h2 class="section-title">A little about me</h2>
    <p class="sub">
      Every big journey starts with a small step.
      I'm learning, exploring new ideas and building
      things that reflect my vision.
    </p>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="symbol">🎯</div>
        <h3>My vision</h3>
        <p>Keep learning, think creatively and turn ideas into reality.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="symbol">🚀</div>
        <h3>My journey</h3>
        <p>Discover new skills, create projects and improve every day.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects">
    <h2 class="section-title">My projects</h2>
    <p class="sub">A place to showcase what I create.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="symbol">🌐</div>
        <h3>YoFath Website</h3>
        <p>My personal corner of the internet, built for my journey.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="symbol">💡</div>
        <h3>Future Ideas</h3>
        <p>New ideas and creative experiments coming soon.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">Let's connect.</h2>
    <p class="sub">Follow my journey and find me on social media.</p>
    <div class="socials">
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/maiadibhou/"
         target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  © <span id="year"></span> YoFath. Made with purpose.
</footer>
<script>
document.getElementById("year").textContent =
  new Date().getFullYear();
</script>
</body>
</html>
